; Installed over the single kit (before the kit split)? Its manifest names
; the paths the add-on archives install now. It is kept once, with its VERSIONS,
; in UP-Term:pkg/legacy, where an add-on's Install finds the files it takes over
; (upupdate ... ONLY=); this kit's manifest replaces it below.
If EXISTS UP-Term:MANIFEST
  If NOT EXISTS UP-Term:pkg/legacy/MANIFEST
    Set uplegacy ""
@HANDEDSEARCH@
    If "$uplegacy" EQ "YES"
      MakeDir >NIL: UP-Term:pkg UP-Term:pkg/legacy
      Copy UP-Term:MANIFEST UP-Term:VERSIONS UP-Term:pkg/legacy CLONE QUIET
    EndIf
    UnSet uplegacy
  EndIf
EndIf
